<h4 class="boldbyline">
Re: Making It Up?
</h4>

<p>
The "truth" here is an abstraction more dynamic than static.  <br />
<br />
What we have here is the battle of unnamed sources, and the Army isn&#8217;t helping much.  We might never know the &#8220;truth,&#8221; but instead only what we choose to believe.<br />
<br />
Anonymity does not equal credibility, and confidence in your sources does not equal truth.  <br />
<br />
I&#8217;ll wait on the sidelines on this one.  Thank you.<br />

</p>
